//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Shared constants.
//
// Lives in the lowest-numbered module because Galaxy needs a declaration before
// its use and modules are concatenated in filename order.
//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// P0 is single player. The map's default slots are 1 = the player, 2 = Hostile.
const int c_p0Player = 1;
const int c_p0Zerg = 2;

// Loose abnormalities. A third slot, and it has to be hostile to the zerg as
// well as to the players -- design 5.1 makes releasing an easy one to meet a
// wave a real tactic, and that is an alliance setting in the map's player
// properties, not something script can arrange. Until that slot is configured
// in the editor, a breached abnormality will simply be on nobody's side of the
// fight it was meant to join.
const int c_abnoPlayer = 3;
